    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/6af4de815fead04ad4a5cac21f01216a.avif?t=1706920533\" /></div><br><br>Originally born during the GMTK 2023 Game Jam, 'Help Bipboop' is a challenging puzzler that will rev your cognitive gears. Guide Bipboop, the autonomously-driven little robot, to his destination. You do not control Bipboop directly. Instead, you arrange the terrain blocks to create his pathway. Once you have fine-tuned your path, hit the play button and Bipboop will perform his pre-programmed movement sequence.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/aa1901bc934038d800d4726d53a8e2bc.avif?t=1706920533\" /></div><br><br>Bipboop's location resets if he falls off the grid or encounters any obstacles that might cause his demise. You must strategically place terrain blocks to keep him on the right path.<br>Here is an example of a movable terrain block:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/1139d442eff96dfa18fd9cf75349d7e8.avif?t=1706920533\" /></div><br><br>The game features various types of terrain blocks, including bridges, walls, buttons, and teleporters, allowing you to craft creative solutions to the puzzles.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/e45fedf223f7cd86668453d112a00588.avif?t=1706920533\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/fef7ee18b769b98ad23a51be03aca918.avif?t=1706920533\" /></div><br><br>'Help Bipboop' also offers a level editor, allowing you to create your own custom levels and share them with your friends, adding a creative and social aspect to the game.",
    "short_description": "Guide Bipboop, the autonomous little robot, through a series of mind-bending puzzles. You don't control Bipboop directly; instead, place terrain blocks strategically to help him reach the end. Are you up for the challenge?",
